  "description": ".Net-based SDK that integrates video capturing and processing functions into software. Implements video and audio playback and capture from a broad range of sources including TV tuners, USB web cams, DV/HDV camcorders, PCI capture cards and IP cameras. Supports AVI, WMV, DV, MPEG-1/2, MP4, FLV and WebM output formats. Samples - https://github.com/visioforge/.Net-SDK-s-samples .",
